Purpose
-------
The application supports both index and NSE equity option chains.  It contains
the verified option-chain, S-Reversal, Magical/AI-LTP, Live, frozen 09:20,
weekly, D-overlay, Dominance and stock-line calculations in this one file.

Included (mapped from V53_Live_Port_Production_Corrected_SENSEX.py)
  * V53 13-column option-chain table and S-Reversal cells.
  * Website adjacent opposite-option delta/gamma reversal projection.
  * Eight reversal-model Magical Lines plus EOR/EOS overlays and TradingView export.
  * Snapshot Boundary Dominance levels/status and TradingView export.
  * Metadata-backed symbol/expiry selectors.

Deliberately excluded
  * trading strategies, signals, entries, exits, targets and stops;
  * position/P&L tracking, trade simulation, backtesting and broker/API orders.

The file can fetch live NSE/BSE option-chain data itself or replay a full-chain
CSV. It is display-only: it calculates and displays levels but never places or
simulates a trade. Live metadata is written beside the workbook on refresh.
"""

